B.OG=s(["New Resource: Wood Pole \ud83c\udf8b \u2014 crafted at the Workshop (Lv 2 required) using 1 \ud83e\udeb5 Wood + an Iron Chisel. Recipe costs 50 \ud83d\udcb0.","Iron tool recipes now require 1 \ud83c\udf8b Wood Pole instead of 2 \ud83d\udfeb Planks.","Iron Chisel recipe reduced to just 1 \u2b1c Iron Bar (no planks required).","Wiki tool entries now show individual crafting recipes.","Potion Brewery now shows a recipe selection menu when assigning a brewer \u2014 choose a potion first, then set a batch quantity. One new recipe unlocks per brewery level starting with Woodland Brew.","Recipe cards in the Brewery, Tool Smith, and Workshop now highlight green when you have all required materials on hand."],t.s)
B.Wp=new A.a3("0.1.3",B.OG)
B.PZ=s(["WIZARD TOWER AND POTION BREWERY!","New Building: Potion Brewery \ud83e\uddea \u2014 brew potions from harvested ingredients. Costs 20 \ud83d\udfeb + 10 \ud83e\uddf1 + 5 \u2b1c to build. Upgrades to Lv 3.","New Building: Wizard Tower \ud83d\udd2e \u2014 cast discovery and transmutation spells using potions. Costs 100 \ud83e\uddf1 + 60 \u2b1c + 30 \ud83d\udc8e + 500 \ud83d\udcb0 to build. Upgrades to Lv 4.","New Ingredients (harvestable tiles unlocked via discovery spells): Flowers \ud83c\udf38 (Field), Maple \ud83c\udf41 (Forest), Lichen \ud83e\uddea (Cave), Shadowmint \ud83c\udf11 (Quarry), Deepbloom \ud83c\udf3a (Deep Mine).","New Potions (brewed at the Potion Brewery): Woodland Brew \ud83e\uddf4, Petal Brew \ud83c\udf76, Forest Tonic \ud83c\udf3f, Cavin Dew \ud83e\uded9, Quarry Tonic \u2697\ufe0f, Deep Mine Brew \ud83d\udd2e.","Wizard Tower: Discovery spells awaken each area's ingredient \u2014 cast Awaken Field, Awaken Forest, etc. to seed ingredients into the spawn pool.","Wizard Tower: Transmutation spells shift spawn percentages in each area. Stage +/- adjustments on any resource and confirm to start the cast. Live preview shows projected percentages in green/red.","Wizard Tower area cards show each resource's current spawn percentage with a progress bar. Upgrades unlock Forest, Cave, Quarry, and Deep Mine cards.","New Research: Petal Brew Consumption \ud83c\udf76 \u2014 enables Petal Brew as a worker food source. 1 Petal Brew covers 3 harvest cycles. Toggle via the dashboard.","New Research: Transmutation Mastery \u2697\ufe0f \u2014 increases the spawn % shifted per transmutation press (0.5% base, up to 7.5% at Lv 5).","Wiki updated with a new Alchemy tab covering ingredients, potions, discovery spells, and transmutation.","Removed Efficient Harvesting research \u2014 the +2% yield per level had no real effect due to integer rounding on most resources."],t.s)
B.Wm=new A.a3("0.1.2",B.PZ)
B.ON=s(["Workshop, Tool Smith, and Forge workers now consume 1 food per craft cycle.","Workstation workers are blocked from assignment when food is insufficient to cover all active workers.","New Tool: Iron Chisel \ud83e\ude9b \u2014 crafted at the Tool Smith (Lv 2 required) for 1 \u2b1c.","New Resource: Stone Bricks \ud83e\uddf1 \u2014 crafted at the Workshop (Lv 2 required) using 1 \u26f0\ufe0f Stone Chunk + an Iron Chisel.","Stone Brick recipe costs 50 \ud83d\udcb0 and takes 15 seconds per brick.","Research Lab upgrade to 3 worker slots now costs 20 \ud83e\uddf1 Stone Bricks, 30 \ud83d\udfeb Planks, and 20 \u2b1c Iron Bars.","Forge now smelts Iron Ore at a 1 to 1 ratio (was 2 \ud83d\udd29 \u2192 1 \u2b1c).","Forge now requires a Hammer \ud83d\udd28 to smelt. Hammer durability is consumed each cycle; mastery applies.","Wood tile cycle base count reduced from 4-8 to 2-4.","Storehouse upgrade to level 2 now costs 20 \ud83d\udfeb Planks, 30 \ud83e\udeb5 Wood, and 30 \ud83e\udea8 Stone.","Trading Post upgrade to level 3 now costs 20 \ud83d\udfeb Planks, 20 \ud83e\udea8 Stone, and 30 \ud83e\udeb5 Wood.","Trading Post upgrade to level 4 now costs 30 \ud83d\udfeb Planks, 20 \u2b1c Iron Bars, and 30 \ud83e\udea8 Stone.","House upgrade to level 3 now costs 20 \ud83d\udfeb Planks and 20 \u2b1c Iron Bars.","Stats now track Tile Tokens Earned, Tile Tokens Sold, Gold Spent, Items Crafted, Research Completed, Resources Sold, and Time Played.","Area navigation buttons now show a circular progress ring while that area is being scouted.","Worker cards now show status and progress when a worker is working the Forge."],t.s)
B.Wb=new A.a3("0.1.1+2",B.ON)
B.PL=s(["New Tile Token currency, obtained when fully clearing out a tile!","Tile Tokens can be sold at a 1 to 1 for gold by tapping the currency in the info bar.","Workshop and Tool Smith can no longer be upgraded while crafting.","Planks are now a tier one recipe in the Workshop.","Tool Smith now supports multiple workers (Lv 1 = 1 slot, Lv 2 = 2 slots), each with their own tool type and craft limit.","New research: Specialized Crafting \u2014 allows each Tool Smith worker to craft a different tool simultaneously (requires Lv 2 Tool Smith).","Workshop now supports multiple workers (Lv 1 = 1 slot, Lv 2 = 2 slots), each with their own recipe type and craft limit.","Forge now uses the same slot-based worker UI as the other crafting buildings.","Craft limit must now be selected when assigning a worker to any crafting building.","Workshop and toolsmith show the appropriate icons for what is being crafted.","Expanded Storage research is now repeatable: each level costs 1 more Tile Token and takes exponentially longer, granting +1 storage cap per resource per level.","Swift Scouts research is now repeatable: each level costs Tile Tokens (scaling) and gives +1% scouting speed per level.","Trading Post now has 5 upgrade levels, each unlocking more resources to sell.","Trading Post Lv 1: Sticks, Berries, Rock. Lv 2: +Wood, Spores. Lv 3: +Stone Chunks, Planks. Lv 4: +Iron, Iron Bars. Lv 5: +Crystal.","Locked items are visible in the Trading Post menu so you can see what each upgrade unlocks.","Research progress card now shows total research time and estimated time to completion.","Research worker cards now show the % progress contributed per cycle."],t.s)
B.WY=new A.a3("0.1.1+1",B.PL)
B.P6=s(["Forge Building added.","The new Forge Building can craft Iron into Iron Bars.","Food Priority button added, find it next to the theme button at the top of the dashboard. (Unlocks upon discovering mushrooms)","Recipes in the Workshop and Tool Smith must be purchased before you can craft items.","New Weapon Mastery System introduced. Unlocks at Iron Tools.","Weapon Mastery gives you points to spend on various upgrades for each tool type.","Tool Smith and Workshop menus reworked.","Workshop no longer continues to produce when inventory is full."],t.s)
B.WT=new A.a3("0.1.1",B.P6)
B.OZ=s(["The Research Lab's tile now displays an icon for the currently active research.","Icon display also extends to what's being crafted in the Workshop and Tool Smith","Bushes in the field now give sticks, which is the new requirement for crafting tools.","Wood can be broken down into sticks at the workshop at a 1 to 4 ratio.","Boulders now have a new icon and give a new stone chunks resource.","Stone Chunks can be broken down into stones at the Workshop at a 1 to 4 ratio.","New Hammer tool craftable in the Tool Smith. Required for workshop to break Stone Chunks into Stone.","Tool Smith and Workshop now display the requirements for a craft.","Dashboard expands dynamically based on game size.","Some Resources and Tiles have been renamed.","Wiki entries for Stone and Sticks now show recipes.","Hut and Workshop Wood requirements are now Sticks."],t.s)
B.Wl=new A.a3("0.1.0+9",B.OZ)
B.Oj=s(["New Dashboard expand button!","Worker Interface changed.","Workshop worker equips a new tool when the current tool breaks.","Workshop has a craft menu now, which allows you to select what you are crafting.","Workshop and Tool Smith now have an input quantity option.","Every upgrade to the hut will now require 1 additional worker.","Areas now have a progressively higher cost to expand and now require an additional worker for every level.","Worker cards expanded in most menus."],t.s)
B.X2=new A.a3("0.1.0+8",B.Oj)
B.PT=s(["In Game WIKI - Please provide feedback","When selecting a building that you can't afford you will now get an error message in the info bar.","Changed the temporary plank icon to a temporary plank emoji. (kinda made more sense)","Scouting an area now unassigns active workers on the game board.","Forest resources modified to: 50% trees, ~37% mushrooms, ~13% rock piles.","Workshop now costs 25 wood and 25 stone."],t.s)
B.WZ=new A.a3("0.1.0+7",B.PT)
B.NX=s(["Areas that have adaptive foraging and/or auto-scout will now display an icon on the bottom right of the board grid.","Worker cards now display information when a worker is upgrading a building","Efficient harvesting is now more of an incremental upgrade","When a worker axe/pick breaks you will get the last harvested material now.","New Researchable for every tile that increases the max cycles.","New Saw tool for processing wood into planks",'New "Workshop" building that processes various materials requiring a worker.',"Time is now displayed in the Area Board upgrade dialogue"],t.s)
B.WV=new A.a3("0.1.0+6",B.NX)
B.No=s(["Themes added!","Storehouses can now be upgraded to level 3, giving a +20 to all resources for every level.","Better area size upgrade dialogue.","Better research and Tool Smith menu UX","Houses can be upgraded to level 4, granting one additional worker per level.","Upgrading area size now requires worker and takes time."],t.s)
B.WP=new A.a3("0.1.0+5",B.No)
B.PN=s(["Buildings now take time to construct and require a worker","Buildings on the homeboard can now be dragged to move","Reduced the cost of the first upgrade to the area boards","Stat tracking system added. Find the button in the dashboard!"],t.s)
B.Wj=new A.a3("0.1.0+4",B.PN)
B.PM=s(["Research building added","Max 3 Research buildings",u.X,"auto-scout","Many more upgrades!","Research is time based, it will advance while you are offline."],t.s)
B.Ww=new A.a3("0.1.0+3",B.PM)
B.P_=s(["Added Trading Post, allowing players to sell items.","Centered Game Board","Area Grids now start at 2x2 and can be upgraded or re-scouted","Each area tier will take more time to scout and cost more to upgradeThe home grid now starts at a 4x4 and can also be upgraded","Research building added",u.X],t.s)
B.We=new A.a3("0.1.0+2",B.P_)
B.Os=s(["Added version number to the info bar","Locked Developer buttons behind a password","Confirmation dialog before resetting the game","Fixed resource distribution weighting in the Field"],t.s)
